><surname>Van Soest</surname><given-names>S</given-names></name><name><surname>De Loof</surname><given-names>A</given-names></name><name><surname>Broeck</surname><given-names>J Vanden</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Transcript profiling of pacifastin-like peptide precursors in crowd- and isolated-reared desert locusts</article-title><source>Biochemical and Biophysical Research Communications</source><year>2004</year><volume>317</volume><fpage>565</fpage><lpage>569</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">15063795</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1016/j.bbrc.2004.03.078</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B8"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Simonet</surname><given-names>G</given-names></name><name><surname>Breugelmans</surname><given-names>B</given-names></name><name><surname>Proost</surname><given-names>P</given-names></name><name><surname>Claeys</surname><given-names>I</given-names></name><name><surname>Van Damme</surname><given-names>J</given-names></name><name><surname>De Loof</surname><given-names>A</given-names></name><name><surname>Broeck</surname><given-names>J Vanden</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Characterization of two novel pacifastin-like peptide precursor isoforms in the desert locust (<italic>Schistocerca gregaria</italic>): cDNA cloning, functional analysis and real-time RT-PCR gene expression studies</article-title><source>Biochemical Journal</source><year>2005</year><volume>388</volume><fpage>281</fpage><lpage>289</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">15631618</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1042/BJ20041414</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B9"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Breugelmans</surname><given-names>B</given-names></name><name><surname>Simonet</surname><given-names>G</given-names></name><name><surname>van Hoef</surname><given-names>V</given-names></name><name><surname>Van Soest</surname><given-names>S</given-names></name><name><surname>Broeck</surname><given-names>J Vanden</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Pacifastin-related peptides: Structural and functional characteristics of a family of serine peptidase inhibitors</article-title><source>Peptides</source><year>2009</year><volume>30</volume><fpage>622</fpage><lpage>632</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">18775459</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1016/j.peptides.2008.07.026</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B10"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Gaspari</surname><given-names>Z</given-names></name><name><surname>Ortutay</surname><given-names>C</given-names></name><name><surname>Perczel</surname><given-names>A</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>A simple fold with variations: the pacifastin inhibitor family</article-title><source>Bioinformatics</source><year>2004</year><volume>20</volume><fpage>448</fpage><lpage>451</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">14990440</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1093/bioinformatics/btg451</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B11"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Simonet</surname><given-names>G</given-names></name><name><surname>Claeys</surname><given-names>I</given-names></name><name><surname>Franssens</surname><given-names>V</given-names></name><name><surname>De Loof</surname><given-names>A</given-names></name><name><surname>Broeck</surname><given-names>J Vanden</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Genomics, evolution and biological functions of the pacifastin peptide family: a conserved serine protease inhibitor family in arthropods</article-title><source>Peptides</source><year>2003</year><volume>24</volume><fpage>1633</fpage><lpage>1644</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">14706543</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1016/j.peptides.2003.07.014</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B12"><citation citation-type="journal"><pe